To enable autocomplete for the `exordos` in bash/zsh, follow these steps:

# bash

- Add content from `https://github.com/exordos/exordos/blob/master/exordos/autocomplete/exordos-complete.bash` to your `~/.bashrc` file
- Restart your shell

# zsh

- Save `https://github.com/exordos/exordos/blob/master/exordos/autocomplete/exordos-complete.zsh` somewhere, for example `~/.exordos-complete.zsh`
- Source the file `. ~/.exordos-complete.zsh` in your `~/.zshrc`
- Restart your shell
